@startuml Sequence - Poll Commands
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "IoT Device (Router)" as Router #DDFFDD
participant "router-manager-service\ngRPC Server" as Grpc #BBFFFF
participant "Security Middleware" as Sec #FFDDDD
participant "Router Service" as RouterSvc #FFFFBB
participant "Command Repository" as CmdRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #DDFFDD
participant "Metrics" as Metrics #FFEECC
participant "Logger" as Logger #EEFFEE
participant "Tracer" as Tracer #CCCCFF

== Роутер запрашивает свои команды (Poll) ==

Router -> Grpc: gRPC PollCommands{router_id}\n[mTLS + IP Whitelist]
activate Router
activate Grpc

Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "poll-commands"\n(trace_id, span_id, router_id)
activate Tracer
Tracer --> Grpc: span context
deactivate Tracer

Grpc -> Sec: Check: IP Whitelist, Rate Limit, mTLS cert
activate Sec
Sec --> Grpc: OK / Error(403)
deactivate Sec

alt Проверка не пройдена
    Grpc -> Tracer: Record error "permission_denied"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: recorded
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc --> Router: gRPC error (PERMISSION_DENIED)
    deactivate Grpc
    deactivate Router
else Проверка успешна
    Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "update-last-seen"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: child span
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc -> RouterSvc: UpdateLastSeen(router_id)\n[span context]
    activate RouterSvc

    ' === ЛОГИКА: обновление last_seen_at ===
    RouterSvc -> DB: UPDATE routers SET last_seen_at = NOW() WHERE id = $1
    activate DB
    DB --> RouterSvc: rows_affected
    deactivate DB
    RouterSvc --> Grpc: nil / error
    deactivate RouterSvc

    Grpc -> Tracer: End span "update-last-seen"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: ended
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc -> Tracer: Start span "get-pending-commands"
    activate Tracer
    Tracer --> Grpc: child span
    deactivate Tracer

    Grpc -> CmdRepo: GetPendingCommands(router_id)
    activate CmdRepo

    ' === АТОМАРНОСТЬ: SELECT FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED ===
    CmdRepo -> DB: BEGIN;
    activate DB
    CmdRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM commands \nWHERE router_id=$1 AND status='PENDING' \nORDER BY created_at \nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    activate DB
    DB --> CmdRepo: []Command
    deactivate DB

    alt Команды найдены
        CmdRepo -> DB: UPDATE commands SET status='SENT', sent_at=NOW() \nWHERE id = ANY($1)
        activate DB
        DB --> CmdRepo: rows_updated
        deactivate DB
        CmdRepo -> DB: COMMIT
        deactivate DB
        CmdRepo --> Grpc: []Command{status=SENT}
        deactivate CmdRepo

        Grpc -> Tracer: Set span attribute "commands_count"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: attributes set
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc -> Tracer: End span "get-pending-commands"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: ended
        deactivate Tracer

        par Логирование и метрики
            Grpc -> Logger: Log: "Commands polled"\n{router_id, count=len}\n[trace_id]
            activate Logger
            Logger --> Grpc: logged
            deactivate Logger

            Grpc -> Metrics: Inc: commands_polled_total{router_id}
            activate Metrics
            Metrics --> Grpc: metric updated
            deactivate Metrics

            Grpc -> Metrics: Observe: poll_latency_seconds
            activate Metrics
            Metrics --> Grpc: observed
            deactivate Metrics
        end

        Grpc -> Tracer: Export spans to Alloy\n[OTLP/gRPC]
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: exported
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc --> Router: gRPC PollResponse{commands: [...]}
        deactivate Grpc
        Router --> Router: Execute commands locally
        deactivate Router
    else Команд не найдено
        CmdRepo -> DB: COMMIT
        deactivate DB
        CmdRepo --> Grpc: empty list
        deactivate CmdRepo

        Grpc -> Tracer: Set span attribute "commands_count=0"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: attributes set
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc -> Tracer: End span "get-pending-commands"
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: ended
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc -> Logger: Log: "No pending commands"\n{router_id}\n[trace_id]
        activate Logger
        Logger --> Grpc: logged
        deactivate Logger

        Grpc -> Tracer: Export spans to Alloy\n[OTLP/gRPC]
        activate Tracer
        Tracer --> Grpc: exported
        deactivate Tracer

        Grpc --> Router: gRPC PollResponse{commands: []}
        deactivate Grpc
        deactivate Router
    end
end

note right of DB
  Атомарность: выборка PENDING-команд
  и обновление на SENT выполняются
  в одной транзакции с SELECT FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  для избежания дублирования при конкурентных poll.
end note

note right of Metrics
  Observability:
  • commands_polled_total{router_id}
  • poll_latency_seconds
  • commands_pending_gauge{router_id}
end note

note right of Tracer
  Tracing:
  • trace_id: уникальный ID poll-запроса
  • span "update-last-seen": обновление last_seen_at
  • span "get-pending-commands": выборка команд
  • attributes: router_id, commands_count
  • Export: OTLP/gRPC → Alloy → Tempo
end note
@enduml